author, MIT) and mirrors the architecture both share: skills + CLI + knowledge base + journal + circuit breaker,
distributed to the same agents the same way. universal-decompiler itself mirrors universal-modder. The files
below contain code or text copied from or derived from universal-modder (through universal-decompiler), used
